msgid "Plan"
msgstr "Tarif"

msgid "Data & validity"
msgstr "Trafik va muddat"

msgid "Supplier sourcing"
msgstr "Ta’minot manbasi"

msgid "Add each supplier's wholesale price under 'Supplier offers' at the bottom of this page. On save the cheapest available one sets the cost, the price, and where the order is placed; the rest become fallbacks used when the winner is out of stock."
msgstr "Har bir ta’minotchining ulgurji narxini shu sahifaning pastidagi «Ta’minotchi takliflari» bo‘limiga kiriting. Saqlanganda mavjudlari ichidan eng arzoni tannarxni, narxni va buyurtma qayerga berilishini belgilaydi; qolganlari g‘olib tugaganda ishlatiladigan zaxiraga aylanadi."

msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "Narxlash"

msgid "Enter the supplier cost and the price is calculated on save. Leave the markup empty to inherit a pricing rule; fill it in to override every rule for this plan alone. Tick 'price locked' to type a price by hand and stop it being recalculated. Use the note for anything the number cannot say on its own, such as '+ deposit' — it is shown to customers beside the price."
msgstr "Ta’minotchi tannarxini kiriting — narx saqlanganda hisoblanadi. Ustamani bo‘sh qoldirsangiz narxlash qoidasi qo‘llanadi; to‘ldirsangiz faqat shu tarif uchun barcha qoidalar ustidan o‘tadi. Narxni qo‘lda yozib, qayta hisoblanishini to‘xtatish uchun «narx qulflangan» ni belgilang. Sonning o‘zi ayta olmaydigan narsa uchun izohdan foydalaning, masalan «+ depozit» — u mijozga narx yonida ko‘rsatiladi."

msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Ko‘rinishi"

msgid "You do not have permission to change tariffs."
msgstr "Tariflarni o‘zgartirishga ruxsatingiz yo‘q."

msgid "Cost and price sheet"
msgstr "Tannarx va narxlar"

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s price(s) saved and locked — the sync will not overwrite them."
msgstr "%(n)s narx saqlandi va qulflandi — sinxronizatsiya ularni o‘zgartirmaydi."

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s tariff(s) returned to automatic pricing."
msgstr "%(n)s tarif avtomatik narxlashga qaytarildi."

#, python-format
msgid "Not a valid price, left unchanged: %(rows)s"
msgstr "Narx to‘g‘ri emas, o‘zgartirilmadi: %(rows)s"

msgid "Nothing changed."
msgstr "Hech narsa o‘zgarmadi."

msgid "Target"
msgstr "Qo‘llanadi"

