msgstr "ulangan ta’minotchi yo‘q"

msgid "Supplier comparison"
msgstr "Ta’minotchilarni solishtirish"

msgid "Save the plan, then add supplier prices below to compare them."
msgstr "Tarifni saqlang, so‘ng solishtirish uchun pastda ta’minotchi narxlarini qo‘shing."

msgid "No supplier offers yet, so the cost above is used as typed and orders route to <b>{}</b>. Add two offers below to have the cheaper one chosen automatically."
msgstr "Hozircha ta’minotchi taklifi yo‘q, shuning uchun yuqoridagi tannarx qanday yozilgan bo‘lsa shundayligicha ishlatiladi va buyurtmalar <b>{}</b> ga yo‘naltiriladi. Arzonrog‘i avtomatik tanlanishi uchun pastda ikkita taklif qo‘shing."

msgid "unavailable"
msgstr "mavjud emas"

msgid "ordered from here"
msgstr "shu yerdan buyurtma qilinadi"

msgid "fallback"
msgstr "zaxira"

