msgstr "Trafik"

msgid "Cost"
msgstr "Tannarx"

msgid "Price"
msgstr "Narx"

msgid "Margin"
msgstr "Marja"

msgid "Calculated margin"
msgstr "Hisoblangan marja"

msgid "Recalculate prices from cost and rules"
msgstr "Narxlarni tannarx va qoidalar bo‘yicha qayta hisoblash"

msgid "Applies to"
msgstr "Qo‘llanadi"

msgid "Pick one. 'Everything' is the house default; a supplier or destination rule overrides it for the plans it covers."
msgstr "Bittasini tanlang. «Hammasi» — asosiy qoida; ta’minotchi yoki yo‘nalish qoidasi o‘zi qamragan tariflar uchun uning ustidan o‘tadi."

msgid "Markup"
msgstr "Ustama"

msgid "What this does"
msgstr "Bu nima qiladi"

msgid "Admin"
msgstr "Boshqaruv"

msgid "In plain words"
msgstr "Oddiy tilda"

msgid "Save the rule to see a summary."
msgstr "Xulosani ko‘rish uchun qoidani saqlang."

msgid "every plan that no more specific rule covers"
msgstr "aniqroq qoida qamramagan har bir tarif"

#, python-format
msgid "every plan sourced from %(p)s"
msgstr "%(p)s dan olinadigan har bir tarif"

#, python-format
msgid "every plan for %(c)s"
msgstr "%(c)s uchun har bir tarif"

#, python-format
msgid "On %(who)s, the selling price is the supplier cost plus %(pct)s%%."
msgstr "%(who)s uchun sotuv narxi tannarx ustiga %(pct)s%% qo‘shilib hisoblanadi."

#, python-format
msgid "If that leaves less than $%(m)s of profit, the price rises until it does."
msgstr "Agar foyda $%(m)s dan kam chiqsa, narx shu darajaga ko‘tariladi."

msgid "The result is then rounded up to end in .99."
msgstr "So‘ng natija .99 bilan tugaydigan qilib yuqoriga yaxlitlanadi."

msgid "The result is then rounded up to the next 50 cents."
msgstr "So‘ng natija keyingi 50 sentga yuqoriga yaxlitlanadi."

msgid "The result is then rounded up to a whole dollar."
msgstr "So‘ng natija butun dollarga yuqoriga yaxlitlanadi."

msgid "This rule is switched off, so it changes nothing right now."
msgstr "Bu qoida o‘chirilgan, shuning uchun hozir hech narsani o‘zgartirmaydi."

msgid "Which plans this rule decides"
msgstr "Bu qoida qaysi tariflarni belgilaydi"

msgid "Save the rule to see its reach."
msgstr "Qamrovni ko‘rish uchun qoidani saqlang."

msgid "No priced plans fall under this rule yet."
msgstr "Bu qoida ostida narxlangan tarif hozircha yo‘q."

#, python-format
msgid "This rule sets the price of %(d)s of the %(c)s plans in its scope."
msgstr "Bu qoida o‘z qamrovidagi %(c)s tarifdan %(d)s tasining narxini belgilaydi."

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s are governed by a more specific rule."
msgstr "%(n)s tasi aniqroq qoida ostida."

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s carry their own markup, which overrides any rule."
msgstr "%(n)s tasining o‘z ustamasi bor — u har qanday qoidadan ustun."

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s have a locked price and are never recalculated."
msgstr "%(n)s tasining narxi qulflangan, qayta hisoblanmaydi."

msgid "What prices would become"
msgstr "Narxlar qanday bo‘ladi"

msgid "Save the rule to preview prices."
msgstr "Narxlarni ko‘rish uchun qoidani saqlang."

msgid "Price now → after"
msgstr "Hozirgi narx → keyin"

msgid "Profit"
msgstr "Foyda"

msgid "A sample of the plans this rule governs. Saving applies it to all of them."
msgstr "Bu qoida qamragan tariflardan namuna. Saqlaganda hammasiga qo‘llanadi."

msgid "Plans covered"
msgstr "Qamrab olingan tariflar"

msgid "Recalculate every affected plan now"
msgstr "Ta’sirlangan barcha tariflarni hozir qayta hisoblash"

