msgid "Needs the columns package_code, location, data_gb, days, cost_usd. The export from the supplier's portal already has them."
msgstr "package_code, location, data_gb, days, cost_usd ustunlari kerak. Ta’minotchi portalidan yuklab olingan faylda ular allaqachon bor."

msgid "Preview only — do not write anything"
msgstr "Faqat ko‘rib chiqish — hech narsa yozilmaydi"

msgid "Leave this on the first time. Applying moves supplier costs, which moves retail prices through the pricing rules."
msgstr "Birinchi marta buni yoqilgan qoldiring. Qo‘llash ta’minotchi tannarxlarini o‘zgartiradi, bu esa narxlash qoidalari orqali chakana narxlarni o‘zgartiradi."

msgid "Limit to these destinations"
msgstr "Faqat shu yo‘nalishlar bilan cheklash"

msgid "Leave empty to apply the whole file. Choosing destinations is how you set one up without repricing everything else."
msgstr "Butun faylni qo‘llash uchun bo‘sh qoldiring. Yo‘nalish tanlash — qolgan hammasining narxini o‘zgartirmasdan bittasini sozlash usuli."

